{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S07、S11等段落的感受意象堆得偏满，个别从音乐质感跳到宏大心理判断，X在这些地方更克制、利落。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的加亮短语让人能先抓住每段的心理落点，小字感受又不会与主线争夺注意力，标记出现时还能与音乐进程对应。它把人物从害怕暴露需要、得到回应、逐渐敢于靠近，到害怕失去、最终接受不确定的变化交代得更细，水波、摇荡、呼吸等意象也反复回扣。虽然个别感受有些堆砌，但整体更容易让普通观众同时获得清楚的故事脉络和具体细腻的听觉体验。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fbe8c055-79e5-4778-aa9d-3dad1c5cd6c7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T205935299122Z", "elapsed_seconds": 152.719, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:02:08.027366+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "123cd75712b4f2c4fa75f237881439f25255673a290904c5b9bd63704cb57582", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py":